Keanu Reeves, and introducing Sadie Frost in her film debut as Lucy Westenra.

13
01:19:14,285 --> 01:19:20,285
Set in 19th-century England and Romania, it follows Count Dracula (Oldman), a vampire who falls in
love with Mina Murray (Ryder), the fiancée of his solicitor Jonathan Harker (Reeves).

14
01:25:20,000 --> 01:25:26,000
When Dracula begins terrorizing Mina's friends, Professor Abraham Van Helsing (Hopkins), an
expert in vampirism, is summoned to bring an end to his reign of terror.

15
01:31:25,714 --> 01:31:31,714
